ch is very easy . It is like painting ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "And I can choose any color ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Yes , we have many colors to choose from , sir ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "And after the varnish ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "After the varnish dries for 24 hours , you can put another coat of varnish on . Or you can put the finish on.The finish is hard and clear . It goes on top of the varnish ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "And then ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Well , when the finish is dry , the table is done ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "It all sounds very complicated ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "It only sounds complicated . It's really very easy . A lot of people here in America finish their own furniture.It ' s a good way to save some money . And a lot of people even enjoy it .\nAlright , sir ."}]}]}
