{"schemaVersion": "bedrock-conversation-2024", "system": [{"text": "You are a helpful conversational assistant. Engage in natural, friendly dialogue."}], "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "It's going to strike 12 o'clock . Let's get the firecrackers ready , Rose ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Aren't firecrackers forbidden in the city ?"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Well yes , but they are not allowed only in downtown areas . It's OK here . It would be difficult to ban customs that have thousands of years of tradition . The habit does bring kids joy and excitement so long as precautions are taken . Let's go out and set off firecrackers out there ."}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Fantastic ! The whole city is echoing with crackling sounds !"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "What other activities will you have tomorrow ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Quite a lot . The celebration of the New Year has just started . The first day we southerners have sweet rice cakes for breakfast , and people in the North have Jiaozi . Afterward , we will make New Year calls on family relatives , husband's side on the first day and wife's side on the second ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Do you bring some gifts along ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "That's for sure . Fruit , cream cakes , medical tonics are often for parents and aged relatives , and cash enclosed in a red envelope for the kids . All this , of course , should be well prepared beforehand ."}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"text": "Is it the same practice for all families ?"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Not all the same nowadays I must say . Many families , especially those of newly married couples , choose to make an overseas trip to escape the routines . Rose and I had a tour to Singapore , Malaysia , Thailand and Hong Kong last year . We stayed there for two weeks until the last day of the holiday .\nWell , for city dwellers , the Spring Festival is a holiday of seven days . While in the country where traditions are still heavily emphasized , the festival lasts ten days ."}]}]}
